{"event": "agent_result", "task": "single-agent", "role": "single_agent", "result": {"report": {"incident_id": "slack-user-043", "outcome": "probable_cause", "hypotheses": [{"description": "Most likely cause: the Cedar Slack action required a user token, but the configured Slack auth had the scope only under bot scopes and no user_scopes, so Slack returned missing_scope for user-token operations. Bot posting working is compatible with this because bot scopes do not authorize user-token actions.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_0e985d9e82d6", "ev_315dcd1e5920", "ev_c6d2d39be65a", "ev_ef8b2f66c4c8"], "contradicting_evidence": [], "confidence": "high", "assumptions": ["The failing Cedar workflow is using the same auth configuration reflected in the observed request log.", "The controlled sandbox comparison is representative of the production failure mechanism for this request shape."]}, {"description": "Less likely alternative: a broader Slack/provider outage or platform-wide regression caused the missing_scope errors.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_5c76760e3107"], "contradicting_evidence": ["ev_0e985d9e82d6", "ev_ef8b2f66c4c8", "ev_315dcd1e5920", "ev_eab110a4ba3c"], "confidence": "low", "assumptions": ["The maple comparison tenant exercised a sufficiently similar provider path to detect a broad outage."]}, {"description": "Less likely alternative: a recent tool-executor deployment introduced the failure.", "supporting_evidence": [], "contradicting_evidence": ["ev_eab110a4ba3c", "ev_387a4b1218f7"], "confidence": "low", "assumptions": ["Deployment telemetry for tool-executor is complete for the incident window."]}], "recommended_actions": ["slack_user_scope_configuration_remediation", "reconnect_required_scope", "request_workspace_admin_access", "monitor_provider"], "limitations": ["No canonical connection record was available; the empty connections result is not treated as proof of absence.", "History evidence is explicitly partial and only an analogy, not current proof.", "Observed logs are sparse; the diagnosis relies on the canonical failing request plus a controlled reproduction rather than broad per-request sampling."]}, "ranked_cause_codes": ["slack_user_scope_configuration", "provider_failure", "unconfirmed_change"], "findings": [{"code": "mechanism_observation", "statement": "The observed Cedar failure is a Slack user-token operation returning missing_scope, while the auth configuration shows bot scopes present but user_scopes empty.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_0e985d9e82d6", "record_id": "slack-user-043:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "scope_mismatch", "statement": "The required token kind was user, but the configured permission appeared only in bot scopes and not in user_scopes, which is consistent with Slack rejecting the request for missing scope.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_0e985d9e82d6", "record_id": "slack-user-043:logs:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_c6d2d39be65a", "record_id": "slack-user-043:knowledge:0"}]}, {"code": "controlled_comparison", "statement": "In controlled reproduction, the original configuration with empty user_scopes reproduced the 403 missing_scope, and changing only the Slack configuration to include the same scope in user_scopes made the same request succeed.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_315dcd1e5920", "record_id": "slack-user-043:reproduce:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_315dcd1e5920", "record_id": "slack-user-043:reproduce:1"}]}, {"code": "tenant_impact", "statement": "Impact was concentrated in Cedar: 400 failures out of 670 requests with 400 business operations blocked, queue depth 120, and p95 latency 1600 ms, while comparison tenant Maple had 0 failures, 0 blocked operations, queue depth 0, and p95 latency 160 ms.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_ef8b2f66c4c8", "record_id": "slack-user-043:metrics:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_ef8b2f66c4c8", "record_id": "slack-user-043:metrics:1"}]}, {"code": "provider_isolation", "statement": "A same-provider comparison tenant succeeded during the incident window, which argues against a broad Slack/provider outage and supports a tenant-specific configuration issue.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_0e985d9e82d6", "record_id": "slack-user-043:logs:1"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_ef8b2f66c4c8", "record_id": "slack-user-043:metrics:1"}]}, {"code": "version_control", "statement": "No tool-executor deployment was observed in the incident window; the only observed deployment was an unrelated support-dashboard release.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_ef8b2f66c4c8", "record_id": "slack-user-043:metrics:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_387a4b1218f7", "record_id": "slack-user-043:deployments:0"}]}], "action_codes": ["slack_user_scope_configuration_remediation", "reconnect_required_scope", "request_workspace_admin_access", "monitor_provider"]}}
